    "body": "Merged #705 (refreshed with main) to resolve conflicts.\n\n- **Main's new routes** live in `feature_click::click`, in main's order: locate (#561), then points (#555), then axis, then plane, then `hint_stray`, then boundary/operation. Main's `pick_face`/`pick_edge`/`pick_vertex` routes are retired with them.\n- **Disarm laws:** #664/#667/#673 are byte-identical to main.\n- **New pin:** `one_pick_rule::locate_and_points_drafts_take_box_corners_as_points`. A locate draft takes a box corner, the points draft takes three corners, and a face clicked into the points draft still gets its by-name refusal.\n\n**One behaviour change to check by hand:** with a locate draft in Face mode, a click within 8 px of a feature point now takes the point; anywhere else it takes the face. On main, points needed Vertex mode.\n\nGate:\n- ui all green: lib 445, one_pick_rule 5, setup_picks_disarm 8, locate_tests 5, setup_points_tests 2.\n- app: lib 107, feature_pick 7, feature_pick_wire 4, pick 9, mcp_pick 3, mcp 13, fixture_locate 11, points_align 8, plane_align 9, plane_align_edges 5, axis_align 10, wcs_align 5, vertex_pick 4, face_origin 3, feature 18, mcp_setup 6.\n- clippy `-D warnings` on ui lib+tests and the app lib: clean.\n\nStill a draft until the hand GUI check (`~/camcraft-builds/camcraft-ui-709` is rebuilt from this head).",
